                                                "sense_id": "6b7fe8b5-d4ed-3d72-a5f1-c505b058ffad",
                                                "text": "And when whe woke again he reappeared in a plastic incubator wearing an absurd little knitted cap like an egg cosy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d9e630f-09d5-4525-b4b5-faf6fe7d3517",
                                                "sense_id": "6b7fe8b5-d4ed-3d72-a5f1-c505b058ffad",
                                                "text": "You lucky girl! Granny's knitted you an egg cosy for your birthday!"
